# ============================================================
# 统一换行符：仓库内部一律存 LF。
# 否则 Windows 队友（core.autocrlf=true）与 Linux 队友之间
# 会出现"全文件都被修改"的假 diff。
# ============================================================
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本仍保持 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# ---------- 二进制文件：不做换行符转换 ----------
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.bmp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.gz binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.ckpt binary
*.onnx binary
*.engine binary
*.npy binary
*.npz binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.mp4 binary
*.avi binary

# ---------- 文本文件：显式声明，便于 diff 与统计 ----------
*.py text
*.md text
*.txt text
*.csv text
*.json text
*.yaml text
*.yml text
*.toml text
*.cfg text
*.ini text
*.msg text
